{"unit_id":"tag:09D1:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 <MATH_0003> 上的单纯环层（simplicial sheaf of rings）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>单纯（simplicial）<MATH_0004>-模（module）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> <MATH_0005>（有时称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>单纯层（simplicial sheaf），由 <MATH_0006>-模（modules）组成<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>）是模（modules）的层（sheaf），定义在 <MATH_0007> 上的环层（sheaf of rings）上，后者与 <MATH_0008> 相联系。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"simplicial sheaf of rings","target_term":"单纯环层"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"simplicial sheaf","target_term":"单纯层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf of rings","target_term":"环层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"单纯模的基"},{"source_term":"simplicial sheaf of rings","target_term":"单纯环层","context":"单纯系数"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯","context":"可译定义名称中的限定词"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"可译定义名称"},{"source_term":"simplicial sheaf","target_term":"单纯层","context":"定义的另一名称"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"层的系数与取值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"乘积位点上的模层"},{"source_term":"sheaf of rings","target_term":"环层","context":"乘积位点上的系数"}],"notes":[]}
