{"unit_id":"tag:09D2:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为 <MATH_0002> 的对象（object）。由于 <MATH_0003> 与余极限（colimits）交换（commutes），只需对上有界（bounded above）复形（complexes）证明，它们由 <MATH_0004>-模（modules）组成（比较《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》命题 <REF_0001> 的论证，或只考虑上有界（bounded above）复形（complexes））。每个这样的复形（complex）都拟同构（quasi-isomorphic）于上有界（bounded above）复形（complex），其各项是平坦模（flat modules），见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0002>。因此，只需对平坦（flat）<MATH_0005>-模（module）<MATH_0006> 证明引理。此时，导出张量积（derived tensor product）就是通常的张量积（tensor product），并且也是层（sheaf）。因而由引理 <REF_0003>，可用引理 <REF_0004> 的过程计算等式两端的上同调层（cohomology sheaves）。因此，只需对 <MATH_0007> 到纤维（fibre）范畴（categories）的限制（restriction）证明结果（即到 <MATH_0008>）。此时结果由引理 <REF_0005> 得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphic","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"flat modules","target_term":"平坦模"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"derived tensor product","target_term":"导出张量积"},{"source_term":"tensor product","target_term":"张量积"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"导出范